'''Lafete diner'''<ref name="The Mandalorian Handbook">''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian Handbook]]''</ref> was located on [[Lafete]]. One time around [[9 ABY]], [[Bo-Katan Kryze]] and [[Koska Reeves]] were eating at the bar, and then [[Mandalorian warrior]] [[Din Djarin]] walked in with [[Boba Fett]] to ask for their [[Second rescue of Grogu|help to rescue]] [[Din Grogu|Grogu]].<ref name="Chapter16" />

